=== 5. reversal-symmetrized PZ (owner item): one-line result + rho_rev table ===
Derivation: V=(U+U∘refl)/2; {V>0} = {U>0} ∪ refl{U>0} has measure <= 2mu;
PZ(V) => mu >= E[U]^2/(E[U^2]+E[U U∘refl]) <= plain PZ since E[U U∘refl] >= 0.
=> symmetrization does NOT improve the moment bound; value = search-pruning.

  rho_rev(AP                        ) = 1.0000  (palindrome => 1)
  rho_rev(monad record              ) = 1.0000  (palindrome => 1)
  rho_rev(EU-min 3adic (non-palin)  ) = 1.0000  (palindrome => 1)
  rho_rev(random big                ) = 1.0000  (palindrome => 1)
